discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity (see 22 CFR 51.25).\",\"start\":183},{\"end\":196,\"field\":\"actor\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:183:196:sha256-0f777c78e109bfd992e4738f9d4d8da5da9433ec4dfe2e094c19036a252cb830\",\"quote\":\"The applicant\",\"start\":183},{\"end\":209,\"field\":\"action\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:202:209:sha256-0818ab2593f5cb6c2daa8ffdd20578aae920bb1ed1f3feecf0cdf09a8b1e1213\",\"quote\":\"explain\",\"start\":202},{\"end\":388,\"field\":\"object\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:210:388:sha256-0dbb0fce4ef2a9cca4904837d0cac8f5cc73af8fae1a0010855d82cd42c4c36a\",\"quote\":\"any material discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity\",\"start\":210},{\"end\":201,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:197:201:sha256-4137b01e139589b7a1d3b3fc4da031d8ce5bb415808734e970c3a58ea0e98f0f\",\"quote\":\"must\",\"start\":197},{\"end\":388,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:237:388:sha256-200afd6de4506d17b74da1e03c71fcdb88bbe2e7ddfac5115023078e7a0c9be3\",\"quote\":\"between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity\",\"start\":237},{\"end\":408,\"field\":\"concepts:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:183:408:sha256-46eeccae8347ce1f970113b9b5f9dda6c260590b05f83769a083b48db312e980\",\"quote\":\"The applicant must explain any material discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity (see 22 CFR 51.25).\",\"start\":183}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:d3a9f2b66f9b9463c135eedb0077fb12f12ca3f8b1ccbd4a174e984059691201\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:93f7c3b3460b58775ba9d545eca839703892f6d0d2708037dee674d12cc7033e\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"must\",\"object\":\"any material discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:fb2e946db1608d03b0ab6cde47efa387304304e04df7f4c7a34f14d621810686\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"The applicant must explain any material discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity (see 22 CFR 51.25).\",\"references\":[\"22 CFR 51.25\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:fb035a5634e1239a350c8f7a7d3a20fc4602b0534868bdcce82d4b634d9a2cf2\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity\"],\"scope_text\":\"Governed by cases where there are material discrepancies between the name on the application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity.\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-section-4\",\"start\":183,\"summary\":\"The applicant must explain any material discrepancies between the name on the passport application and the name recorded in the evidence of U.S. citizenship or non-citizen U.S. nationality and the evidence of identity.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
