b2befee\",\"quote\":\"The applicant may not continue to use a previous name after a material name change unless the name change documentation specifically permits the applicant to continue using that name (see 8 FAM 403.1-6 regarding “known as” names).\",\"start\":1201},{\"end\":1214,\"field\":\"actor\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1201:1214:sha256-0f777c78e109bfd992e4738f9d4d8da5da9433ec4dfe2e094c19036a252cb830\",\"quote\":\"The applicant\",\"start\":1201},{\"end\":1238,\"field\":\"action\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1223:1238:sha256-7a79ca74d197263cd5f1f8ca314f8d02f068caf91019268aac6b37dbf2ff1401\",\"quote\":\"continue to use\",\"start\":1223},{\"end\":1254,\"field\":\"object\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1239:1254:sha256-e7b2d8d6c605f4ab427e4e67867f70e0749b5b453991adcb45fc262de60fab00\",\"quote\":\"a previous name\",\"start\":1239},{\"end\":1290,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1284:1290:sha256-c8a69f69754487458ba1b8ff473d119702d7e43925fae45475156780939bc606\",\"quote\":\"unless\",\"start\":1284},{\"end\":1222,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1215:1222:sha256-0007a8bea4dcd3f6b1490fc7199650f1046713dd92d9314e1f2ede6946fcd999\",\"quote\":\"may not\",\"start\":1215},{\"end\":1283,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc975875306