epartment guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant\",\"start\":1512},{\"end\":1573,\"field\":\"action\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1562:1573:sha256-e9472e01d4d170627fa7d4a7b6a1e55d7f09df18e921120aea200bc05fb46a10\",\"quote\":\"be required\",\"start\":1562},{\"end\":1555,\"field\":\"object\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1535:1555:sha256-f30948c1391413dbd020413d43f1b7b59b62e70ac5ce9b7e9645b2071eca38f1\",\"quote\":\"evidence of identity\",\"start\":1535},{\"end\":1561,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1556:1561:sha256-f23be8eed45492f4b5315117a6ed033788fa26715014cd26c4a059c02ea16cad\",\"quote\":\"might\",\"start\":1556},{\"end\":1669,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1574:1669:sha256-034d1045514f99ca7a0a378208436aebd1cdccc1e724543e97c7afd1b1b7fab4\",\"quote\":\"in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant\",\"start\":1574},{\"end\":1497,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1436:1497:sha256-86c5c10f194b8fae4059abff950eaa687734f5a0dfa1d33421733da1e697f00e\",\"quote\":\"The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity.\",\"start\":1436},{\"end\":1669,\"field\":\"concepts:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a